The derived source files under src/ carry an individual header identifying
them as derived work and describing the modifications made. Notable
modifications relative to umap-js:

  * Ported from the original TypeScript to strict TypeScript targeting
    ml-umap's compiler settings.
  * src/nn/heap.ts: fixed an inverted loop condition in smallestFlagged
    (`i > ind.length` -> `i < ind.length`). Upstream's condition is false on
    entry, so the function always returned -1 and the graph-search refinement
    in nn-descent never executed. This affects transform() only; fit() does
    not reach that code path.
  * src/umap.ts: getEmbedding() returns a copy rather than the live internal
    array; getEmbeddingRef() provides the previous behaviour.
  * src/transform.ts: transform() no longer aliases the fitted embedding into
    the optimizer's tail slot, so projecting a batch the same size as the
    training set can no longer corrupt the model.
  * src/sparse/: the sparse matrix is a coordinate/typed-array implementation
    replacing upstream's string-keyed Map, retaining identical semantics.
  * src/serialize.ts: new code, not derived from umap-js.

